# Evals — run artifacts under evals/results/ ARE committed (they're the accuracy
# history), and so is evals/ground_truth.json: CI gates on `score --offline`, which
# can't reach EDGAR, so a gitignored pin would be no pin at all on a fresh checkout.
# .cache/ is the pre-pin layout, kept ignored so stale local copies stay out of diffs.
backend/evals/.cache/

